  "description": {
    "html": "<p>Featured in the Aditya Roy Kapur Collection, this three-piece Jodhpuri set is crafted in rich cream Matka silk and styled with a layered navy-and-white printed kurta and matching cream trousers. The structured jacket features a classic mandarin collar, a curved front cutaway hemline, and statement sapphire-blue jeweled buttons along the placket. An ornate crest brooch on the chest adds a distinguished finishing touch, while the interplay of crisp tailoring and artisanal prints creates a sharp, contemporary silhouette. An elegant choice for wedding receptions, sangeet evenings, and festive celebrations.</p>",
